      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r4:3",
      "document_id": "r4",
      "document_sha256": "d4c6075fd69e3be395633c2234d500c26bcfaa67a939a5b83f4a6d4c1ba9a122",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-A10786-aa59eb69",
      "start": 94,
      "end": 143,
      "text": "The chapter here followeth of secret Coniunction,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[4]/lg[1]/l[3]",
        "gate": 4,
        "stanza": 1,
        "line": 3,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r4:4",
      "document_id": "r4",
      "document_sha256": "d4c6075fd69e3be395633c2234d500c26bcfaa67a939a5b83f4a6d4c1ba9a122",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-A10786-aa59eb69",
      "start": 144,
      "end": 194,
      "text": "Which Natures repugnant ioyneth to perfect vnitie,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[4]/lg[1]/l[4]",
        "gate": 4,
        "stanza": 1,
        "line": 4,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r4:5",
      "document_id": "r4",
      "document_sha256": "d4c6075fd69e3be395633c2234d500c26bcfaa67a939a5b83f4a6d4c1ba9a122",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-A10786-aa59eb69",
      "start": 195,
      "end": 247,
      "text": "And so them knitteth that none from others may flie,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[4]/lg[1]/l[5]",
        "gate": 4,
        "stanza": 1,
        "line": 5,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r4:6",
      "document_id": "r4",
      "document_sha256": "d4c6075fd69e3be395633c2234d500c26bcfaa67a939a5b83f4a6d4c1ba9a122",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-A10786-aa59eb69",
      "start": 248,
      "end": 283,
      "text": "When they by fire shalbe examinate,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[4]/lg[1]/l[6]",
        "gate": 4,
        "stanza": 1,
        "line": 6,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r4:7",
      "document_id": "r4",
      "document_sha256": "d4c6075fd69e3be395633c2234d500c26bcfaa67a939a5b83f4a6d4c1ba9a122",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-A10786-aa59eb69",
      "start": 284,
      "end": 323,
      "text": "They be togethers so surely coniungate.",
